Patches to wasix-libc, the C library in the WASIX sysroot guests are built
with.

toolchain/bootstrap.sh checks wasix-libc out at the sysroot's tag under
work/wasix-libc, applies the series, builds libc from it with wasix-libc's
own build for each sysroot variant wasixcc can target, and puts that libc.a
into the downloaded sysroot. A patch goes away when the sysroot tag carries
the fix.

Except where otherwise noted, Copyright (c) 2026 Ethan Jones.

0001-chdir-lock-relative-path-resolution.patch is wasi-libc commit
aa9b5c0820fc (https://github.com/WebAssembly/wasi-libc/pull/781, by CPunisher)
applied to wasix-libc's copy of the file; it remains the copyright of its
author.

